<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24498" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηρῐάομαι</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῆρις</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>contend,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ νεκροῦ δηριάασθαι</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηρίσασθαι</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				17.734
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥστ᾽ ἀμφ᾽ οὕροισι δὔ ἀνέρε
				δηριάασθον</span>
			<i>wrangle</i> about boundaries, <i><span class="en">
				12.421
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅ τ᾽ ἄριστοι . . δηριόωντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.78
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ δ᾽ αὐτοὶ δηριαάσθων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.467
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τινί</span>
			<i>contend with</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1729
			</span></i>.— Later 
				Act.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηρῐάω</span></b> , <i>contest a
				prize,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				11.26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίφροι δηριόωντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.752
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				1.230
			</span></i>.—From <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηρίομαι</span></b>  (used by <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				13.44
			</span></i>) <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> has aor. 1
			
				Med.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηρίσαντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.76
				</span></i>
			: 3dual
			aor. 1
			
				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηρινθήτην</span> (as if from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηρίνομαι</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.756
			</span></i> (later 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηρινθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.16
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θέντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euph.
					98.3
				</span></i>
			): fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηρίσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					22.70
				</span></i>
			: also in aor.
			
				Act.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηρισάντοιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					995
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἅν τοί τις ἐδήρισεν περὶ τιμῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					25.82
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				1306
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ</span> in
			pres.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ</span> in
				fut. and aor.]</div>
